{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_title", "source_sha256": "25464ef2ad3c66888935eed6f0c941297a52b9b7fe143a78c12eedc9d32c1bf7", "ja": "伊織とおでかけ1", "zh": "和伊织外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "033114fb9b5f50e90ff336219d6091198eae8780600aa59e7c14134297c245e5", "ja": "伊織とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和伊织一同出门的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52b6f590d49ddfc43f14d1023b2af11345018e1ffa9a0ab7d6dbab272dcf6dfd", "ja": "伊織、もう来てたのか。集合時間前に\n会場入りするなんて、気合いが入ってるんだな。", "zh": "伊织，你已经到了啊。居然在集合时间前就进场了，干劲十足嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "0907d484da9797489dbf313c095dd66c5fbee6e874f87f1ea6d8b3618bfbbc7d", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。当然でしょ？\nここは私たちの劇場じゃないもの。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。这不是理所当然的吗？\n毕竟这里又不是我们的剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "54c3637eef2b609de9c9077771c79cda8be5e2d9f73860ea7ad328d10c896bab", "ja": "どんなトラブルが起こるかわからないんだから、\nいろいろ確認しておこうと思っただけよ。", "zh": "毕竟不知道会发生什么麻烦，我只是想先确认一下各方面的情况而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0b4162f61911a245f78c10117fda44bf138b0d96e0e74073db139daf81100216", "ja": "おお、なるほどな。\nその意識の高さ……さすがだな！", "zh": "哦，原来如此。你这觉悟真高……不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "5d2f77f5f4e5fe96b7091b6513dc2d9eac60786d0028b23bf671b6739a0b8c9b", "ja": "さすがだな……？\nなにのんきなこと言ってるのよ！", "zh": "真不愧是……？\n你在悠哉地说什么呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "962f5c3c14a60d399ca964b6d957ae2c1aae3311348fddcefa97be7154cd7f60", "ja": "そういうのはプロデューサーの仕事！\nアンタが私より早く来ないでどうすんのよ！", "zh": "这种事是制作人的工作！\n你要是不比我更早到，那怎么行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2e5dc3770c8dd7b053d37762e36f871c5101dec195afa0a5af4232340040e6f4", "ja": "ご、ごめん。\nこれでも早く来たつもりなんだけど……。", "zh": "对、对不起。\n我本来是打算早点来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "91fb46b0083b399cf20992ea36d3d20aaa2f91f65a0837b39fb7902f939a9268", "ja": "でも、ありがとう。ライブについての確認で、\n他になにか手伝うことはあるか？", "zh": "不过，谢了。关于演唱会的确认，还有什么需要我帮忙的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "6aff500d8701faa562a72820e1aa9a099ce5896c45b78091b90cb436c80b7da0", "ja": "そうねえ……大きな声を出したら、のどが渇いたわ。\n超高級オレンジジュースを買ってきてちょうだい。", "zh": "是啊……大声喊了一通，嗓子都渴了。去给我买超高级橙汁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b1d76723adec36f45a9bdf812d6bbc0149000045b12a7ddeb531dc6f72e73603", "ja": "いいけど、ライブには直接関係ないような……。", "zh": "买是可以，但这好像和演出没有什么直接关系吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_007ior01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_007ior01_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "230100a61a66f541df40c5da93d2ff5b3efa14ef2a6e0e0a144614033a16978c", "ja": "文句言わない！　伊織ちゃんの命令には、\n常に感謝して駆け足よ♪", "zh": "不许有异议！对于伊织的命令，\n你随时都得心怀感激、随叫随到才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
